# Mapper 243 has corrupted graphics (Honey Peach)

- Source URL: https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/NES_MiSTer/issues/446

Mapper 243 is listed as being both supported and with save states, but the only game that it supports, Honey Peach, has corrupted graphics.

---

## Pull Request

**PR Title:** Mapper 141: Add 8KB unbanked CHR-RAM variant (Q boy), mapper 243: Fix CHR addressing (Honey Peach)

**PR Number:** #448

**Status:** Merged on Dec 19, 2025

### Description

The contributor notes that the unlicensed Sachen game Q Boy uses "a unique mapper" recognized as mapper 141. The PR enables "8KB unbanked CHR-RAM this game needs when CHR-RAM flags are set in the header." Headers in the no-intro set are reported as correctly configured.

The submission also includes a fix for mapper 243, which affects only one game.

